## UI/UX Design Principles

- Modern flat design style
- Dark theme as primary, support light theme switching
- Responsive layout, support window resizing
- Real-time waveform and spectrogram display
- Intuitive model layer visualization

---

## Main Feature Modules

### 1. Audio Data Management
- Support multiple audio formats (WAV, MP3, FLAC, OGG, etc.)
- Audio file import and batch loading
- Waveform visualization and audio playback

### 2. Feature Engineering
- Time-domain features: Waveform, energy, zero-crossing rate
- Frequency-domain features: FFT spectrum, power spectral density
- Time-frequency features: STFT, Mel spectrogram, MFCC

### 3. Data Augmentation
- Time stretching/compression
- Pitch shifting
- Adding noise

### 4. Model Building
- Visual drag-and-drop model construction
- Preset acoustic model templates (1D-CNN, 2D-CNN, LSTM, etc.)
- Custom layer parameter configuration

### 5. Training Monitoring
- Real-time Loss/Accuracy curves
- Training progress display
- Early stopping and learning rate scheduling

### 6. Model Evaluation
- Confusion matrix
- Classification report
- Audio prediction testing

---

## Language Guidelines

### AI Communication & Coding
- **All communication with AI assistant**: Use English
- **Code comments**: Use English
- **Docstrings**: Use English
- **Variable and function names**: Use English
- **Commit messages and documentation**: Use English

### Software UI
- **Default UI language**: Chinese (Simplified)
- **Source UI strings**: English gettext msgids wrapped with `tr_(...)`
- **Translations**: Chinese and English catalogs under `src/locale/`
- **UI labels, tooltips, and messages**: Do not hardcode Chinese in Python unless explicitly intentional; update gettext catalogs for user-facing text changes

